  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> The sling bullet snaps your forearm near the wrist, both the ulna and the radius breaking into multiple fragments. With all the nerves and tendons that just got disrupted it’s unlikely you’ll regain full function in your hand.</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3). The hand is useless (see under Amputated Parts), but if you receive Surgery within one week it’ll count as a Broken Bone (Major) instead, except all Tests for long-term penalties automatically fail.</p>"
    },
